  "prefLabel": "Saf-Mec 204.01 Principles of Dispute Resolution",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-Mec 204.01 Principles of Dispute Resolution. The board shall resolve by agreement or by a decision all disputes about non-criminal matters within the scope of RSA 153:16(b) and RSA 153:27 through RSA 153:38 and the administrative rules implementing those statutes.\n\nSource. #10798, eff 3-18-15",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-mec200.html"
